msgid ""
"Open managed satellite UI at the URL from Console (SAP `http_url`), "
"typically the companion sidecar HTTP port."
msgstr "在管理台提供的 URL（SAP `http_url`）打开托管卫星 UI，通常为："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:47
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Shell satellites (Chat, **Console, etc.) open in desktop / mobile / web "
#| "shell routes; no dedicated port."
