#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance allocation strategies"
msgstr "实例分配策略"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:51
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "`instance_id` is a 3-character lowercase alphanumeric id (see [`packages/"
#| "sap-contract/src/naming.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/naming.ts)). "
#| "It appears in platform strings (`sap:{app_slug}:{instance_id}`), session "
#| "`platform_extra`, and SAP tool names. **Do not remove it from the "
#| "protocol** — but each satellite app picks an **allocation strategy** "
#| "suited to its product model:"
msgid ""
"`instance_id` is a 3-character lowercase alphanumeric id (see [`src/shared/"
"sap-contract/naming.ts`](../../src/shared/sap-contract/naming.ts)). It "
"appears in platform strings (`sap:{app_slug}:{instance_id}`), session "
"`platform_extra`, and SAP tool names. **Do not remove it from the protocol** "
"— but each satellite app picks an **allocation strategy** suited to its "
"product model:"
msgstr ""
"`instance_id` 是 3 位小写字母数字 id（见 [`packages/sap-contract/src/"
"naming.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/naming.ts)）。它出现在平台字符串"
"（`sap:{app_slug}:{instance_id}`）、会话 `platform_extra` 与 SAP 工具名中。**"
"请勿从协议中移除**——但每个卫星应用会选择适合其产品模型的**分配策略**："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:56
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Strategy      | Meaning                                | Apps                                        | Client behavior                                                                 |\n"
#| "| ------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| **singleton** | One fixed id per Hub for the whole app | **Chat** (`def`)                            | Always send `instance_id` on `connect`; Hub auto-provisions if missing          |\n"
#| "| **machine**   | One id per physical device / install   | **Companion**, **pair-programming** (today) | Omit `instance_id` on first connect; Hub assigns randomly; persist locally      |\n"
#| "| **workspace** | One id per open workspace / project    | **Pair-programming** (future)               | Switch workspace → switch `instance_id` and reconnect — **not implemented yet** |\n"
msgid ""
"| Strategy      | Meaning                                | Apps             | Client behavior                                                            |\n"
"| ------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **singleton** | One fixed id per Hub for the whole app | **Chat** (`def`) | Always send `instance_id` on `connect`; Hub auto-provisions if missing     |\n"
"| **machine**   | One id per physical device / install   | **Companion**    | Omit `instance_id` on first connect; Hub assigns randomly; persist locally |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 策略          | 含义                                   | 应用                                        | 客户端行为                                                                      |\n"
"| ------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **singleton** | 整个应用在 Hub 上固定一个 id           | **聊天室**（`def`）                         | `connect` 时始终发送 `instance_id`；缺失时 Hub 自动预配                         |\n"
"| **machine**   | 每台物理设备 / 安装一个 id             | **Companion**、**结对编程**（当前）         | 首次连接省略 `instance_id`；Hub 随机分配；本地持久化                            |\n"
"| **workspace** | 每个打开的工作区 / 项目一个 id         | **结对编程**（未来）                        | 切换工作区 → 切换 `instance_id` 并重连 — **尚未实现**                           |\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:57
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "flowchart TB\n"
#| "  subgraph policies [Allocation strategies]\n"
#| "    Singleton[\"singleton: chat → def\"]\n"
#| "    Machine[\"machine: companion → per machine\"]\n"
#| "    Workspace[\"workspace: pair-programming → per project future\"]\n"
#| "  end\n"
#| "  Singleton --> Platform1[\"platform = sap:chat:def\"]\n"
#| "  Machine --> Platform2[\"platform = sap:companion:{machineId}\"]\n"
#| "  Workspace --> Platform3[\"platform = sap:pairprogramming:{projectId}\"]\n"
msgid ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph policies [Allocation strategies]\n"
"    Singleton[\"singleton: chat → def\"]\n"
"    Machine[\"machine: companion → per machine\"]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Singleton --> Platform1[\"platform = sap:chat:def\"]\n"
"  Machine --> Platform2[\"platform = sap:companion:{machineId}\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph policies [Allocation strategies]\n"
"    Singleton[\"singleton: chat → def\"]\n"
"    Machine[\"machine: companion → per machine\"]\n"
"    Workspace[\"workspace: pair-programming → per project future\"]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Singleton --> Platform1[\"platform = sap:chat:def\"]\n"
"  Machine --> Platform2[\"platform = sap:companion:{machineId}\"]\n"
"  Workspace --> Platform3[\"platform = sap:pairprogramming:{projectId}\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:68
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "**Chat (singleton):** all desktop / mobile clients share `CHAT_INSTANCE_ID` (`def`) so `conversation.list` is unified across devices. Chat registers no satellite tools; multiple devices may connect with the same id (**Console shows the last `http_url`).\n"
msgid "**Chat (singleton):** all desktop / mobile clients share `CHAT_INSTANCE_ID` (`def`) so `conversation.list` is unified across devices. Chat registers no satellite tools; multiple devices may connect with the same id (Console shows the last `http_url`).\n"
msgstr "**聊天室（singleton）：** 所有 desktop / mobile 客户端共享 `CHAT_INSTANCE_ID`（`def`），使 `conversation.list` 跨设备统一。聊天室不注册卫星工具；多台设备可用同一 id 连接（管理台显示最后的 `http_url`）。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Companion (machine):** `~/.anima/companion/instance.json` — one id per computer.\n"
msgstr "**Companion（machine）：** `~/.anima/companion/instance.json` — 每台计算机一个 id。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:72
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Hub [`SapInstanceRegistry`](../../platform/src/sap/instance-registry.ts): "
#| "omit `instance_id` → random allocation; send known id → reconnect or "
#| "**auto-provision** if the id is valid and unused."
msgid ""
"Hub [`SapInstanceRegistry`](../../src/platform/sap/instance-registry.ts): "
"omit `instance_id` → random allocation; send known id → reconnect or **auto-"
"provision** if the id is valid and unused."
msgstr ""
"Hub [`SapInstanceRegistry`](../../platform/src/sap/instance-registry.ts)：省"
"略 `instance_id` → 随机分配；发送已知 id → 重连，或在 id 有效且未占用时**自动"
"预配**。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite access modes"
msgstr "卫星访问模式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Rule:** each `app_id + instance_id` has **at most one** active entry in `SatelliteManager` (last connect wins). Multiple WebSockets with the same id are not rejected but stream events follow each socket's own context.\n"
msgstr "**规则：** 每个 `app_id + instance_id` 在 `SatelliteManager` 中**最多**有一条活跃记录（最后连接胜出）。相同 id 的多条 WebSocket 不会被拒绝，但流事件跟随各 socket 自身上下文。\n"

